message: >-
  AVEngine does not yet have a released paper or DOI. Cite the pinned software
  version and the upstream Habitat and SoundSpaces works listed in CITATIONS.bib.
type: software
title: "AVEngine: Habitat-native audiovisual dataset engine"
abstract: >-
  Private research software for deterministic, identity-preserving audiovisual
  episode generation on a pinned Habitat-Sim and RLR foundation. Runtime and
  dataset capabilities beyond the M0 planning baseline remain roadmap work.
